---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base lang="en" title="About" description="About silveryj: self-hosting, infrastructure and AI engineering.">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p class="sub">
    I like building things myself and then keeping them running. This site and the platform behind it are the result.
  </p>

  <h2>What I do</h2>
  <p>
    Most of my time goes into a small server at home: Proxmox virtualization, containerized services, Tailscale
    networking and the Cloudflare edge. In parallel I run local language models and wire chat, retrieval,
    roleplay and image generation into one usable stack.
  </p>
  <p>
    I care less about "it runs" and more about: is the config in Git, is deployment automatic, can I debug it
    when it breaks, are secrets contained, and will it survive disk and traffic limits.
  </p>

  <h2>Skills</h2>
  <div class="skills">
    <div>
      <h3>Infrastructure</h3>
      <p>Proxmox VE · Linux · Docker / Compose · Caddy · nginx · MariaDB · Redis · Samba</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Networking & Edge</h3>
      <p>Tailscale (MagicDNS / Services) · Cloudflare (Tunnel / Access / DNS / Workers AI) · reverse proxy & TLS</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Automation & GitOps</h3>
      <p>Git (Gitea / GitHub) · webhook delivery · GitHub Actions self-hosted runners · Bash / Python / PowerShell</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>AI Engineering</h3>
      <p>llama.cpp · CUDA inference · embeddings (bge-m3) · RAG · agent tool calling · OpenAI-compatible APIs</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Web</h3>
      <p>Astro · WordPress · HTML / CSS / TypeScript · responsive and accessibility basics</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Timeline</h2>
  <ul class="timeline">
    <li>
      <time>2026 · 10</time>
      <div>
        <strong>Self-hosted platform consolidated</strong>
        <p>GitOps delivery, GitHub Actions bidirectional sync, Cloudflare Access zero trust, AI inference and RAG stack integrated.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <time>2026 · 10</time>
      <div>
        <strong>cf-ai-proxy open-sourced</strong>
        <p>Cloudflare Workers AI brought into the local AI stack as a zero-dependency single-file gateway.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <time>Earlier</time>
      <div>
        <strong>Incremental builds</strong>
        <p>Started from WordPress and static sites, gradually replaced with infrastructure I maintain myself.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Email: <a href="mailto:adriantzj07@gmail.com">adriantzj07@gmail.com</a><br />
    GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/silveryj-atzj" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">silveryj-atzj</a>
  </p>

  <p class="back"><a href="/en/">← Back to home</a></p>
</Base>

<style is:global>
  .skills { display: grid; gap: 16px; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); margin: 16px 0 8px; }
  .skills > div { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; }
  .skills h3 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 14px; }
  .skills p { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--muted); }
  .timeline { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 16px 0; }
  .timeline li { display: flex; gap: 18px; padding: 14px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .timeline time { flex: 0 0 90px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); padding-top: 3px; }
  .timeline strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 3px; }
  .timeline p { margin: 0; font-size: 13.5px; color: #c3d0de; line-height: 1.7; }
  .back { margin-top: 36px; }
</style>
